# Deus Ex (P1, Unreal engine): use, jump, lean, toggle run, a long press for a hotkey, and Start's gestures.
setup packs/deus-ex.padpack Deus Ex
model dualsense
tap south 40
tap east 40
tap dpad-left 40
tap dpad-right 40
tap ls 40
tap ls 40
press west
advance 600
release west
tap start 30
advance 400
tap start 30
advance 100
tap start 30
advance 400
---
mouse Right down        @0
mouse Right up          @40
key KEY_SPACE down      @40
key KEY_SPACE up        @80
key KEY_Q down          @80
key KEY_Q up            @120
key KEY_E down          @120
key KEY_E up            @160
key KEY_X down          @160
key KEY_X up            @200
key KEY_APOSTROPHE down @740
key KEY_APOSTROPHE up   @840
key KEY_ESC down        @1120
key KEY_ESC up          @1120
key KEY_KPPLUS down     @1400
key KEY_KPPLUS up       @1430
